                "comment": "Don't think I've ever seen a professor put less effort into a class. All the content is prerecorded and online. There is 1 quiz (unlimited attempts), 1 hw assignment, and 1 in class assignment per week all effectively completion grades by the TA. Only things that are actually graded is 2 exams and project. Class is beyond boring and feels useless.",
